From: sjcsf <346224915+llsf2020@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:05:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/12] FreeChat: join private rooms with a password;
 screenshot blocking setting

- Room Security & Privacy (admins): set/remove the join password, copy the
  room link, and block screenshots for the room (com.freechat.privacy;
  enforced on Android, not possible in browsers)
- Room preview of a room you cannot see: 'Have a password? Join with it'
  opens a masked password dialog; on success the client joins normally
- API helpers for /_matrix/client/unstable/com.freechat with tests
